=== REASONING ===
1. Define StateReader as a 3-method interface (State, SignalAt, Timeline) per ADR-002
2. SignalValue = any (alias) — opaque change-feed payload, distinct from existing signal.Value L1-cache struct
3. State = map[string]SignalValue (signal-name -> latest derived value)
4. FieldMapping{Signal,Field} maps Tesla signal name to output JSON field name
5. TimelineRow{Timestamp,Fields} + custom MarshalJSON flattens to {ts, <field>:value, ...} for backwards-compat
6. TimelineOptions{CollapseBy []string} — empty=chart mode (every change), non-empty=list mode (collapse consecutive duplicates)
7. GoDoc on every exported symbol with ADR-002 reference
8. Trusted-caller and concurrency contracts documented on the interface (per ADR-002 SECURITY MODEL section)
9. Test file: noopStateReader satisfies interface, MarshalJSON flat shape test, MarshalJSON ts-precedence test

